Dialogue: 10,0:00:03.36,0:00:09.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami adalah Enam Uskup\Nyang memiliki mana di atas rata-rata.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:09.44,0:00:15.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami ingin membebaskan Naga Kiamat\Ndan menghancurkan seluruh dunia.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:16.34,0:00:20.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oke, kalian sudah tahu apa\Nyang harus dilakukan, bukan?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.53,0:00:25.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,H-Hmph! Bukan berarti aku ingin\Ndibina olehmu, Kakak Sayang!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:25.36,0:00:28.17,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Aku cuma berharap dikit, kok!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:28.17,0:00:32.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mewujudkan adik perempuan mesum\Nversi kita sendiri!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:32.18,0:00:35.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa?!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:05.49,0:02:08.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku bertemu orang-orang\Ndi Gereja Kuno Senjakala.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:08.64,0:02:10.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dan kami membuat minuman favorit dewa,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:10.56,0:02:12.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,yaitu mayones, bersama-sama.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:13.14,0:02:15.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bikin sesuatu bareng-bareng itu\Nternyata asyik banget.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:16.19,0:02:18.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Interaksi seperti inilah\Nyang seru saat bepergian.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:20.16,0:02:22.43,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Bukankah itu yang ingin Anda perlihatkan?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:22.43,0:02:23.83,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Bukan!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:23.83,0:02:26.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa ini juga "iklan"?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:26.90,0:02:30.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh, apa aku harus\Nmenyentuh "lewati iklan" ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:31.89,0:02:34.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Masih 13 detik lagi baru bisa lewati iklan?!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:34.68,0:02:39.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku cuma ingin melihat\Nvideo tutorial bikin mayones!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:39.60,0:02:41.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pembinaannya nanti saja, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:42.80,0:02:45.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Su-Sudah jadi.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:46.98,0:02:48.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah jadi!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:49.33,0:02:51.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini adalah bukti iman kita.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:51.94,0:02:55.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Perwujudan kebijaksanaan\Nyang berada di luar sistem dunia
Dialogue: 10,0:02:55.44,0:02:57.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,tanpa melibatkan skill dan sihir.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.77,0:03:02.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Beliau melakukan semua ini\Ndemi menyampaikannya?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.78,0:03:05.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:06.11,0:03:09.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku bersyukur karena mereka tampak\Nbersenang-senang membuat mayones.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:10.56,0:03:11.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh, iya.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:12.30,0:03:15.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Untuk merayakan keberhasilan,\Nbagaimana kalau kita foto bareng?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.51,0:03:19.73,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Sudah siap?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:19.73,0:03:21.72,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Berapa satu tambah satu?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:21.72,0:03:22.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dua!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.02,0:03:24.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bodoh sekali.\NItu pertanyaan jebakan.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:24.89,0:03:30.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar. Persamaan "1 + 1 = 2"\Ntidak berlaku dalam setiap kondisi.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:30.20,0:03:31.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jawaban yang benar adalah...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:33.49,0:03:35.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Diam.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.82,0:03:39.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nah, kita sudah foto,\Nsekarang mari kita makan!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.67,0:03:41.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selamat makan!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.22,0:03:52.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini sih bumbu!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:53.27,0:03:54.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oke.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.64,0:03:58.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mayones bisa disimpan di tempat sejuk\Ndan gelap hingga dua minggu.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.53,0:04:00.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tolong habiskan sebelum itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.69,0:04:02.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sebuah kehormatan besar.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:02.49,0:04:05.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami akan menyimpan\Ndan menyembahnya di kuil.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.43,0:04:06.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Disembah?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:06.73,0:04:09.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dan kami ingin memberikan ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.29,0:04:11.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:11.38,0:04:14.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini adalah artefak\Nyang disebut Batu Pemanggil.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.91,0:04:18.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anda bisa memanggil siapa pun\Nyang telah terdaftar dalam artefak ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.11,0:04:24.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jika Anda butuh bantuan kami,\Ntolong panggil kami dengan benda itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.44,0:04:26.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami akan segera datang.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.82,0:04:29.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wah! Terima kasih banyak!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.62,0:04:32.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekarang kita sudah jadi bestie, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.67,0:04:33.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,"Bestie"?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.22,0:04:37.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih untuk semuanya!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:37.22,0:04:39.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sampai jumpa lagi!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:43.00,0:04:47.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia adalah dewa kita.\NSosoknya bagaikan badai.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.71,0:04:48.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.61,0:04:51.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, itu tadi adalah momen-momen terbaik.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.82,0:04:56.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Meski hanya tahu cara menghancurkan,\Nakhirnya kita bisa menciptakan sesuatu.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:57.18,0:05:00.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah lama aku tidak merasa seperti ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.13,0:05:03.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namun,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.68,0:05:06.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,kenapa Rawa Petir membeku?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.58,0:05:07.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Entahlah.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.27,0:05:15.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka baik sekali, ya.\NAku senang karena bisa bepergian.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.67,0:05:17.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Omong-omong,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.16,0:05:22.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku harus cari tempat singgah dulu,\Njadi aku ingin ke Kota Pelabuhan Aquas,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.24,0:05:24.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,tempat bertolak kapal\Nmenuju ibu kota kerajaan.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.42,0:05:27.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa arahnya sudah benar?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.07,0:05:32.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wah!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.96,0:05:34.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Laut!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.75,0:05:39.82,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Selain bisa makan hidangan laut,\Nada banyak kegiatan asyik di sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.82,0:05:41.90,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Aku senang bisa ke sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.22,0:05:46.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku ingin melihat laut,\Nsetidaknya sekali seumur hidup.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.42,0:05:52.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini adalah aroma laut!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:53.89,0:05:57.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Keren! Luas! Keren!\NLautnya keren banget!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.07,0:06:03.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pokoknya aku harus ke kota dulu.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:04.53,0:06:05.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baiklah.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:07.18,0:06:08.64,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Terjang Membabi!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.13,0:06:16.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Halo!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.96,0:06:18.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Si-Siapa itu?!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.69,0:06:19.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan gentar!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:19.60,0:06:21.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lindungi kota kita!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.47,0:06:26.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,O-Oh, ternyata kamu petualang.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.58,0:06:29.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bahkan rank silver? Semuda itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.57,0:06:33.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf sudah mengarahkan senjata kepadamu.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.91,0:06:36.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami agak waspada karena\Nbanyak monster belakangan ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.91,0:06:38.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benarkah?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.29,0:06:40.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pasti sulit.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:40.51,0:06:43.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa dia tidak tahu situasi kota ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.96,0:06:45.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namun, kalau dia rank silver...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.76,0:06:49.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hentikan itu!\NJangan melibatkan gadis manis ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.89,0:06:51.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.47,0:06:54.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak, sebenarnya...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.13,0:06:56.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak bermaksud buruk.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.93,0:06:59.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sebaiknya kamu pergi\Ndari sini sebelum besok.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.78,0:07:01.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Memangnya ada apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:02.36,0:07:03.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Besok itu...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.76,0:07:07.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,hari Rabu.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.20,0:07:10.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Iya, memang.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.16,0:07:14.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Halo!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:16.20,0:07:19.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tumben ada tamu di saat-saat seperti ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.02,0:07:20.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada urusan apa di kota ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.98,0:07:22.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sedang berwisata.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.96,0:07:26.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku ingin tinggal di sini selama seminggu.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.56,0:07:28.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa kamu serius?\NBesok itu...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.42,0:07:31.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,hari Rabu.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.31,0:07:33.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.80,0:07:38.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada apa, sih? Hari Rabu?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.47,0:07:43.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah, sudahlah!\NSaatnya berwisata!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.00,0:07:47.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hidangan laut segar, ya?\NKira-kira seperti apa rasanya?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.33,0:07:49.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pasar ikannya di sini, kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.62,0:07:52.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,A-Apa ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:52.91,0:07:56.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semua tokonya tutup?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:59.39,0:08:01.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hi-Hidangan lautku.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.93,0:08:03.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tolonglah!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.34,0:08:06.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Izinkan kami naik kapal!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.22,0:08:08.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kota ini sudah tamat!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.96,0:08:10.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita harus lari!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.53,0:08:14.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kok hari-hariku kerap\Ndihiasi kejadian seperti ini, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.92,0:08:15.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sebentar.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.80,0:08:19.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jika dipikir-pikir, bukankah aku\Nterlalu sering terlibat masalah?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.87,0:08:22.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa aku dikutuk?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.76,0:08:25.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namun, aku belum berbuat apa-apa kali ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.11,0:08:28.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak salah, kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.07,0:08:31.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Permisi, kalian kenapa?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.16,0:08:34.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Memangnya kenapa lagi?\NKami mau kabur dari hari Rabu!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.53,0:08:37.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hari Rabu?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.51,0:08:39.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semuanya salah hari Rabu!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.36,0:08:43.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Seharusnya hari Rabu\Ntidak pernah ada di dunia ini!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.79,0:08:45.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh, begitu.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.07,0:08:49.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ti-Tidak!\NAku sudah muak dengan hari Rabu!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:49.20,0:08:50.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Aku benci hari Rabu\N- Mereka sangat benci hari Rabu.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.71,0:08:52.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,- yang merenggut semuanya!\N- Mereka sangat benci hari Rabu.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:52.00,0:08:52.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Terkutuklah hari Rabu!\N- Mereka sangat benci hari Rabu.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:52.64,0:08:54.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Terkutuklah hari Rabu!\N- Apa yang terjadi?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:54.78,0:08:59.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak mau pusing.\NCari tahu lewat Internet saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.24,0:09:03.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kesannya biasa saja,\Ntapi inikah penyebabnya?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:05.82,0:09:09.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sepertinya aku harus\Nmengambil Misi Hari Rabu ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.20,0:09:13.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh, iya, bagaimana dengan\NSerikat Petualang di kota ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.60,0:09:21.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan-jangan, serikat ini
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.37,0:09:25.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,adalah serikat positif yang menyenangkan?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.56,0:09:29.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Halo!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.24,0:09:34.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lo-Loh, kok?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.29,0:09:36.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Serikat menyenangkan?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.72,0:09:38.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa bukan, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.04,0:09:41.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sudah tidak sanggup kerja.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.49,0:09:42.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ma-Maaf.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.76,0:09:49.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, ada apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.38,0:09:53.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada yang bisa dibantu?\NApa ada masalah lagi di kota?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.09,0:09:56.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ti-Tidak.\NAku adalah petualang.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.33,0:09:59.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku ingin ikut Misi Hari Rabu.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.38,0:10:04.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:05.40,0:10:07.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Akhirnya!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:08.27,0:10:09.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Syukurlah!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:09.93,0:10:11.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kebetulan ada satu orang\Nyang melarikan diri...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.71,0:10:14.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh, maksud saya,\Nnaik ke jenjang lebih tinggi.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.51,0:10:18.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu datang di saat yang tepat!\NAda banyak pekerjaan menguntungkan!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.84,0:10:20.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini kesempatan cari uang!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:20.60,0:10:21.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nah, ini kontrak budak...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.89,0:10:25.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maksud saya, kontrak magang,\Njadi silakan tanda tangan di sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.12,0:10:26.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ba-Baiklah.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.56,0:10:27.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hentikan itu!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.77,0:10:30.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ketua Serikat.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.88,0:10:34.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pantas saja berisik.\NTernyata ini terjadi lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.90,0:10:36.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita memang kurang orang, tapi...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:37.70,0:10:38.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gadis ini...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.05,0:10:41.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gadis ini...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:42.42,0:10:44.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Imyutt!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:44.82,0:10:48.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku kurang setuju mengirim\Ngadis seimut ini ke medan perang.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:49.74,0:10:51.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf tiba-tiba menyela.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.58,0:10:57.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku adalah Aries Téa Bluemoon,\NKetua Serikat Petualang Aquas.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.49,0:11:00.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namaku Lorna Hermichu...\NHermit.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:00.93,0:11:03.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Duhh! Muach! Muach! Muach!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:03.90,0:11:04.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf, bukan apa-apa.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:06.83,0:11:11.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yang jelas, aku senang kamu\Nbersedia bertarung demi kota ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:12.27,0:11:17.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, mungkin hari Rabu di kota ini\Nmasih terlalu berbahaya untukmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.33,0:11:21.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benarkah?\NKatanya level rekomendasinya 20 ke atas.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:21.81,0:11:25.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Level rekomendasi?\NAku tidak paham maksudmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:26.26,0:11:27.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lihat mereka.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:28.14,0:11:29.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada apa dengan mereka?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:30.02,0:11:33.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka adalah orang-orang\Nyang pernah melalui hari Rabu.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.38,0:11:34.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Raut wajah mereka lebih tegar.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:35.74,0:11:38.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka bisa seperti itu\Nhanya karena melalui hari Rabu?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:38.80,0:11:39.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.37,0:11:43.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Awalnya kami juga meremehkan hari Rabu.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.06,0:11:47.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Monsternya memang banyak,\Ntapi itu cuma terjadi seminggu sekali
Dialogue: 10,0:11:47.82,0:11:49.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan kami kira pasti ada akhirnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:50.62,0:11:54.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Awalnya kami bisa bercanda\Ndan menganggapnya hari cuan.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:55.95,0:11:56.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namun,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:57.25,0:12:00.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,hari Rabu tidak berubah\Nselama lebih dari setahun.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:02.34,0:12:05.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Penduduk kota ini mulai kehilangan harapan.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.74,0:12:07.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kemudian,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:08.78,0:12:10.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,kehancuran terjadi dalam sekejap.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:11.68,0:12:14.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Para pedagang dan petualang pun\Nmenyerah dan meninggalkan kota ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:15.01,0:12:16.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami kekurangan orang dan suplai.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.85,0:12:19.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bahkan kami tidak mampu\Nmemperbaiki perlengkapan rusak.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:20.13,0:12:23.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sisanya hanya para prajurit\Nyang siap bertarung sampai mati.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:24.32,0:12:26.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itulah keadaan di kota ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.93,0:12:30.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mi-Misi Hari Rabu ternyata seram.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.53,0:12:34.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namun, dalam keadaan seperti itu,\Nbukankah kalian makin butuh bantuan?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:34.45,0:12:36.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan khawatir, Lornachan.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:37.47,0:12:41.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Meski hanya dengan kekuatan sendiri,\Nkami pasti akan mengakhiri hari Rabu,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:42.38,0:12:45.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan mengembalikan kedamaian kota ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.67,0:12:49.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saat hari itu datang,\Nberkunjunglah ke sini lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.48,0:12:54.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami akan menyiapkan banyak\Nmakanan lezat untuk menyambutmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:54.26,0:12:55.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Aries.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:56.92,0:12:58.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:58.42,0:13:02.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sudah tahu semua solusinya,\Njadi biar kubereskan dengan cepat!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:02.67,0:13:04.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku jadi sulit bilang begitu.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:05.44,0:13:07.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sejujurnya aku ingin segera membereskannya
Dialogue: 10,0:13:07.81,0:13:10.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,agar bisa berwisata di sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.62,0:13:14.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau dipikir-pikir, aku belum\Npernah bertarung dalam kelompok.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.38,0:13:19.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jika ikut penyerbuan bersama,\Nmungkin aku tidak bisa bekerja sama.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:19.01,0:13:21.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku juga belum terbiasa memakai sihir\Ndalam situasi seperti itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.30,0:13:25.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar juga.\NAku belum berpengalaman.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:26.45,0:13:29.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan-jangan, Nona Aries\Nsudah menyadari hal itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:32.37,0:13:35.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baiklah.\NAku tidak jadi ikut Misi Hari Rabu.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:36.34,0:13:38.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu sudah mengerti, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:38.40,0:13:41.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya. Sepertinya aku masih belum siap.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:42.02,0:13:45.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh, tapi bolehkah aku menguangkan material?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:45.87,0:13:49.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku dapat banyak material\Ndalam perjalanan ke kota ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.06,0:13:53.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tentu saja. Kami memang\Nmembutuhkan banyak suplai.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.22,0:13:56.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Syukurlah!\NBaiklah, tolong diurus.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:00.48,0:14:06.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa ini surai Singa Petir Eleon?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:06.22,0:14:07.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eleon?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.80,0:14:10.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh, sepertinya aku pernah mengalahkannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:10.93,0:14:14.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh? Apa kamu lewat Rawa Petir?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:14.40,0:14:16.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya. Soalnya itu jalan tercepat.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:18.27,0:14:22.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Satu-satunya kelompok\Nyang berhasil kembali dari rawa itu
Dialogue: 10,0:14:22.00,0:14:23.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,adalah kelompok Reinharte si Angin Kilat,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:23.97,0:14:27.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,sang petualang genius\Nyang lenyap lima tahun lalu, kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.17,0:14:28.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Be-Benar.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:29.30,0:14:33.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selain itu, jika material ini\Ndipakai untuk membuat senjata...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:35.81,0:14:38.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selamat datang di Serikat Petualang Aquas!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:38.82,0:14:41.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini adalah serikat positif dan menyenangkan!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:41.40,0:14:42.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:42.69,0:14:45.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namun, aku ingin segera pergi...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:45.40,0:14:46.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu bilang apa, sih?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:46.98,0:14:49.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu sudah jadi salah satu dari kami, kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:49.94,0:14:51.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh? Tadi katanya...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:51.29,0:14:52.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semuanya!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:52.56,0:14:56.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mari sambut rekan baru kita\Ndengan suasana paling meriah!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.46,0:14:59.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo lakukan!\NNah, tepuk tangan!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:02.72,0:15:03.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mohon kerja samanya!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:04.05,0:15:05.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mohon kerja samanya!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:05.41,0:15:06.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mohon kerja samanya!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:06.64,0:15:07.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mohon kerja samanya!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.18,0:15:09.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mohon kerja samanya!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:09.46,0:15:10.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mohon kerja samanya!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:10.80,0:15:12.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mohon kerja samanya!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:14.83,0:15:18.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ternyata ini memang serikat positif\Nyang sangat menyenangkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.04,0:15:21.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku akan mengerjakan Misi Hari Rabu!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.41,0:15:30.03,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Indah sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:30.03,0:15:34.80,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Kalau tidak salah,\Ntempat ini adalah Pantai Urs, kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.80,0:15:37.12,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Kamu tahu banyak, ya, Lornachan!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.12,0:15:39.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu imut dan cerdas!\NKamu sangat luar biasa!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.87,0:15:42.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh? Te-Terima kasih.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:42.56,0:15:44.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi apa yang harus kulakukan...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:44.75,0:15:45.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:46.46,0:15:49.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia bahkan tahu Pantai Urs?!\NHebat sekali!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:49.02,0:15:51.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wawasannya sangat luas!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:51.06,0:15:52.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Lorna hebat!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:53.42,0:15:56.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Lorna! Lorna! Lorna!\N- Lorna! Lorna! Lorna!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:58.40,0:16:01.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nasib kota ini bergantung pada\Nupaya kita menyenangkannya!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:01.42,0:16:04.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pokoknya kita harus\Nmemujinya setinggi langit!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:04.00,0:16:06.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana?\NApa pujian kami berhasil?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.79,0:16:11.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Biasa saja, kok.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:11.86,0:16:13.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Bagus! Sepertinya berhasil!\N- Bagus! Sepertinya berhasil!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:14.90,0:16:16.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nah.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:16.50,0:16:21.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pantai Urs ini adalah tempat\Nkemunculan monster setiap hari Rabu.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:21.82,0:16:25.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jika kita membuat dinding di sini\Ndan mencegah penyerbuan monster,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:25.04,0:16:27.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,ini bisa menciptakan rasa aman, kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:27.73,0:16:31.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dengan begitu, kupikir orang-orang\Nakan berkenan kembali ke kota ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:31.43,0:16:32.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitu rupanya.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:33.28,0:16:33.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namun,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:34.35,0:16:36.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku belum melihat kemajuan.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:36.98,0:16:38.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa bisa rampung sebelum besok?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:40.10,0:16:42.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu ngomong apa, sih?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:42.54,0:16:45.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jika tidak rampung tepat waktu,\Ntinggal dirampung-rampungkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:45.89,0:16:48.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh? A-Apa begitu?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.24,0:16:50.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Loh?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:51.95,0:16:57.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu, apa yang harus kulakukan?\NAku tidak punya skill pembangunan.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:57.63,0:17:01.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak. Bukan itu tugasmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:02.30,0:17:03.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada monster!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:10.58,0:17:13.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Lindungi dindingnya!\N- Hei, hati-hati!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:16.83,0:17:19.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sial!\NKenapa serangan tadi bisa kena?!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:19.06,0:17:22.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka menyerang kita sambil\Nmemanipulasi ruang subdimensi!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:22.23,0:17:25.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lagi pula, kenapa ikan\Nbisa bertarung di darat?!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:25.39,0:17:27.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini enggak logis sama sekali!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:28.88,0:17:31.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Padahal kita bergadang\Nuntuk membuat dinding ini!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:31.28,0:17:33.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku enggak mau lembur lagi!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:34.59,0:17:36.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nah, seperti inilah keadaannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:36.86,0:17:38.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selain kekurangan orang dan suplai,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:38.94,0:17:43.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,monster juga muncul di luar hari Rabu,\Njadi pembangunannya cukup terhambat.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:43.50,0:17:46.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, aku ingin kamu\Nmengalahkan monster-monster itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:46.98,0:17:50.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tunggu, apa mereka baik-baik saja?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.78,0:17:52.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka sampai berteriak keras.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:52.75,0:17:53.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka baik-baik saja!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.82,0:17:57.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Serikat kami masih memegang\Nrekor keselamatan kerja sempurna!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:57.20,0:17:59.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,O-Oh, begitu?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:59.78,0:18:03.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selain itu, aku cukup mahir dalam\Nbidang penyembuhan dan dukungan.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:04.72,0:18:06.42,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Pemanggilan Roh Air!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:06.69,0:18:09.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak!\NKetua sudah bersiap-siap!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:11.42,0:18:12.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semuanya!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:12.53,0:18:15.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Waktunya penyembuhan, sialan!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:15.07,0:18:17.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak!\NJangan sembuhkan aku!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:17.41,0:18:19.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku masih pengin istirahat!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:20.69,0:18:22.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah beres!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:22.96,0:18:26.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lornachan, lakukan saja sebisamu\Ntanpa memaksakan diri.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:26.32,0:18:27.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ba-Baik!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:28.13,0:18:31.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, mungkin aku mulai\Nmengalahkan monster-monsternya, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:33.68,0:18:35.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka semua tampak kesulitan.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:35.90,0:18:38.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak boleh menahan diri\Nhanya karena enggan menonjol.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:39.87,0:18:42.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku juga harus bertarung\Ndengan sungguh-sungguh!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:44.46,0:18:49.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jika monsternya berkumpul di sekitarku,\Naku bisa menggunakan sihir secara serius.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:49.86,0:18:52.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini tampak agak mencolok,\Ntapi manfaatnya sangat besar.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:57.79,0:18:58.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Petit Thunder!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:00.90,0:19:03.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sejujurnya kota ini di ambang kehancuran.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:04.34,0:19:07.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begini terus, kami tak mungkin\Nbisa menghadapi hari Rabu berikutnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:08.96,0:19:10.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini memang memalukan,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:11.07,0:19:15.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi nasib kota ini bergantung pada\Nseberapa lama Lornachan bertarung.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:16.59,0:19:20.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena itu, aku hanya\Nbisa melakukan satu hal.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:20.80,0:19:23.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mempercayai Lornachan dan membuatnya senang!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:25.92,0:19:27.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,I-Itu...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:28.27,0:19:30.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Penguasa Laut Pesisir, Gigalodon!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:31.17,0:19:32.85,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Kenapa bos area muncul di sini?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.31,0:19:35.23,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Semuanya! Mundur sekarang juga!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:37.51,0:19:40.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Na-Namun, Nona Aries,\Nkalau tidak ada dindingnya...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.77,0:19:42.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita tidak mungkin bisa mengalahkannya!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:42.90,0:19:44.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita harus mengutamakan keselamatan!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:45.18,0:19:46.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku akan melindungi bagian belakang...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.60,0:19:48.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lornachan?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:49.18,0:19:51.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa yang kamu lakukan?!\NCepat menjauh dari sana!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:53.86,0:19:54.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukan begitu!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:56.30,0:19:58.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa kamu malah menghampiri Gigalodon?!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:01.47,0:20:03.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, tunggu!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:04.11,0:20:05.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Petit Thunder!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:14.62,0:20:17.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Loh? Gelar apa ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:17.55,0:20:19.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa tadi ada bos area?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:21.18,0:20:22.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Aries!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.56,0:20:25.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sudah mengalahkan monsternya!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:26.18,0:20:28.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalian tadi tampak bermasalah.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:28.21,0:20:30.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa ada masalah?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:30.62,0:20:34.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah, tidak.\NMasalahnya baru saja beres.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:34.62,0:20:36.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh? Begitu, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:37.63,0:20:40.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ga-Gadis mungil ini
Dialogue: 10,0:20:40.43,0:20:42.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,mengalahkan bos area\Ndengan satu kali serangan?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:43.06,0:20:45.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa dia benar-benar manusia?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.62,0:20:47.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siapa sebenarnya Lornachan ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.81,0:20:53.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan-jangan, dia malaikat\Nyang diutus dewa?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:54.29,0:20:55.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wah! Monsternya muncul...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:55.73,0:20:56.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Petit Thunder!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:58.74,0:21:00.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,O-Oke!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:00.32,0:21:02.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan pedulikan monsternya\Ndan buat dinding pertahanannya!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.33,0:21:04.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ketua, kemarilah!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:05.14,0:21:06.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada yang terluka!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:07.68,0:21:09.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,MP-ku hampir habis!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:10.11,0:21:11.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ramuannya?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:11.22,0:21:14.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ti-Tidak ada!\NPersediaan kita habis!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:14.02,0:21:15.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak mungkin!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:16.02,0:21:18.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, minum saja obat ini!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:19.26,0:21:21.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wah! Lukanya langsung hilang!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:21.95,0:21:24.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,MP-nya juga pulih sepenuhnya!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:24.35,0:21:26.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,O-Obat macam apa ini?!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:26.75,0:21:28.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini adalah ramuan mujarab elf.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:28.40,0:21:32.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku masih punya 200 botol,\Njadi minum saja tanpa ragu!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:34.61,0:21:36.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Monsternya muncul lagi!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:38.02,0:21:39.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak ada habisnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:39.77,0:21:41.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah, aku tahu!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:42.62,0:21:44.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lornachan!\NKamu mau apa kali ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:44.80,0:21:46.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Petit Wall!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:47.94,0:21:49.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nah, beres!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:49.66,0:21:53.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jika ada tembok ini, kalian bisa bikin\Ndinding pertahanan dengan tenang!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:54.80,0:21:57.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Loh? Ada apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:58.11,0:21:59.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ti-Tidak.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:00.24,0:22:03.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukankah tembok itu saja sudah cukup?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:03.50,0:22:05.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan-jangan,
Dialogue: 10,0:22:05.31,0:22:08.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lornachan bisa membereskan semuanya sendiri?
